  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "Dans les forêts où il vit, la végétation\npousse bien car il transforme les\nfeuilles mortes en engrais.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "black",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/17/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Forests where Swadloon live have superb\nfoliage because the nutrients they make\nfrom fallen leaves nourish the plant life.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "black",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/17/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il se protège du froid en s’emmitouflant\ndans une feuille. Il se déplace en forêt\net mange les feuilles tombées par terre.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "white",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/18/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It protects itself from the cold\nby wrapping up in leaves. It stays on\nthe move, eating leaves in forests.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "white",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/18/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Preferring dark, damp places,\nit spends the entire day eating\nfallen leaves that lie around it.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "black-2",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/21/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Preferring dark, damp places,\nit spends the entire day eating\nfallen leaves that lie around it.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "white-2",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/22/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "クルマユの　すむ　もりは　くさきが\nよく　そだつ。クルマユが　おちばを\nえいようぶんに　かえているのだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "두르쿤이 사는 숲은 초목이\n잘 자란다. 두르쿤이 낙엽을\n영양분으로 바꾸기 때문이다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Dans les forêts où il vit, la végétation pousse bien\ncar il transforme les feuilles mortes en engrais.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es wandelt herabgefallenes Laub in Nährstoffe um.\nIn Wäldern, wo es Folikon gibt, fühlen sich Pflanzen\npudelwohl.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "La vegetación abunda en los bosques que habita. Este\nPokémon transforma las hojas caídas en nutrientes.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Le foreste in cui vive Swadloon sono lussureggianti,\npoiché trasforma le foglie morte in sostanze nutritive.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Forests where Swadloon live have superb foliage\nbecause the nutrients they make from fallen leaves\nnourish the plant life.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "クルマユの　住む　森は　草木が\nよく　育つ。クルマユが　落ち葉を\n栄養分に　変えているのだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "La vegetación abunda en los bosques que habita. Este\nPokémon transforma las hojas caídas en nutrientes.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "はっぱで　からだを　つつみこんで\nさむさを　ふせぐ。てぢかな　おちばを\nたべながら　もりを　いどうする。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "잎사귀로 몸을 감싸\n추위를 막는다. 가까이 있는 낙엽을\n먹으며 숲을 이동한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il se protège du froid en s’emmitouflant dans une\nfeuille. Il se déplace en forêt et mange les feuilles\ntombées par terre.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es schützt sich vor Kälte, indem es sich in Blätter\neinwickelt. Es durchstreift Wälder und frisst\nherabgefallenes Laub.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Se guarece del frío envolviéndose en hojas. Se\ndesplaza por el bosque comiendo a su paso las\nhojas caídas.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Si protegge dal freddo avvolgendo il corpo nelle\nfoglie, che ha l’abitudine di mangiare in giro per la\nforesta.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
