    {
      "flavor_text": "きの　ねもとで　しずかに　くらす。しんせんな　はっぱよりも　やわらかくなった　おちばを　エサに　このむ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "나무뿌리에서 조용히 지낸다. 신선한 잎사귀보다 부드러워진 낙엽을 먹이로 선호한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "會在樹根旁靜靜生活。比起新鮮的葉子，牠更愛吃變軟的落葉。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il mène une vie paisible près des racines des arbres et préfère se nourrir de feuilles mortes et ramollies plutôt que de feuilles fraîches.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es führt ein ruhiges Leben zwischen den Wurzeln von Bäumen. Statt frischen Blättern nimmt es lieber weiches herabgefallenes Laub zu sich.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Vive tranquilo junto a las raíces de los árboles. Prefiere alimentarse de las hojas caídas y ya reblandecidas antes que de hojas frescas.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Vive quietamente ai piedi degli alberi. Preferisce nutrirsi di foglie morte perché più morbide rispetto a quelle fresche.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
